  "seoBody": "<h2>Why it fits Ireland</h2><p>In Ireland, HIQA regulates residential care. A registered service runs the same audits again and again. Quickler records each walk and writes the report. See the <a href=\"/pages/hiqa-compliance-software-ireland.html\">HIQA compliance page</a>.</p><h2>Inside the EU, under GDPR</h2><p>Your records are held on EU servers in Germany and handled in line with GDPR.</p><h2>One tool for many checks</h2><p>Care home audits, site safety walks, and electrical, gas or vehicle checks. Send your own form and Quickler builds it into a Check.</p><h2>Questions</h2><h3>Does Quickler work in Ireland?</h3><p>Yes. It works anywhere WhatsApp does.</p><h3>Where is the data stored for Irish customers?</h3><p>On EU servers in Germany, handled in line with GDPR.</p><h3>Can I use my own safety and inspection forms?</h3><p>Yes. Send your own form or report in Word or PDF. Quickler fills it in from what you say, send and photograph.</p><h3>Do I need to install a new app?</h3><p>No. You answer in WhatsApp. There is no login on site.</p><h3>Is Quickler an official HSA or regulator product?</h3><p>No. It helps you record the walk. You judge compliance and sign.</p><p>Read our <a href=\"/pages/guides.html\">guides</a>, try the <a href=\"/pages/demo.html\">demo</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">contact us</a>. See <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">global field compliance</a>, our <a href=\"/pages/services.html\">workflows</a> and the <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html\">help centre</a>.</p>",
